    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chronicon: Survivors is a fast paced horde survival game based on the ARPG <strong>Chronicon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a mix of familiar and new dangerous foes in fast paced 20 minute rounds, featuring random events, boss fights, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain gold to permanently unlock skills, perks, masteries and even items in a passive skill tree with over 100 nodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer gold and perform feats of strength to increase your standing with deities and restore their shrines, letting their Avatars spawn in combat and grant you powerful Boons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boons let you specialize your build into one or several synergetic elements, with special effects, triggers, and stat modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through 6 different and increasingly challenging maps to unlock more items, weapons, and a total of 10 playable characters - each with an unique weapon and passive skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map features 2 bosses with unique attack patterns to keep you on your toes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon offers a choice of upgrades, letting you pick the upgrade path you want, such as increased range, attack speed, number of projectiles, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the build and style you want to play, banish the items you don't want, and pray at Shrines to increase your chances of getting the items you desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Can you survive?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 minute rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ map modifiers that can be enabled or disabled for increased rewards and unique challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Boons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ Items &amp; Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons don't just stack - you pick the upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passive skill tree as meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Mastery upgrade for each character, offering a new unique effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map offers a set of unique enemies, events, bosses, and unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Codex with stats on characters, items, achievements, and general gameplay stats</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chronicon: Survivors is a fast paced horde survival game based on the ARPG <strong>Chronicon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a mix of familiar and new dangerous foes in fast paced 20 minute rounds, featuring random events, boss fights, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain gold to permanently unlock skills, perks, masteries and even items in a passive skill tree with over 100 nodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer gold and perform feats of strength to increase your standing with deities and restore their shrines, letting their Avatars spawn in combat and grant you powerful Boons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boons let you specialize your build into one or several synergetic elements, with special effects, triggers, and stat modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through 6 different and increasingly challenging maps to unlock more items, weapons, and a total of 10 playable characters - each with an unique weapon and passive skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map features 2 bosses with unique attack patterns to keep you on your toes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon offers a choice of upgrades, letting you pick the upgrade path you want, such as increased range, attack speed, number of projectiles, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the build and style you want to play, banish the items you don't want, and pray at Shrines to increase your chances of getting the items you desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Can you survive?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 minute rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ map modifiers that can be enabled or disabled for increased rewards and unique challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Boons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ Items &amp; Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons don't just stack - you pick the upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passive skill tree as meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Mastery upgrade for each character, offering a new unique effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map offers a set of unique enemies, events, bosses, and unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Codex with stats on characters, items, achievements, and general gameplay stats</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fight a mix of familiar and new dangerous foes in this fast paced horde survival game! Upgrade your weapons, unlock new items &amp; characters, advance in the permanent passive skill tree, and try to survive the horde!",
